// The third module: it reaches both `fits` and writes the name.
//
// Only one of the two is API, so only one of them is a name this file can be
// referring to. Moving the private one out of the way used to take this
// reference along with it, and the call then ran the helper of a module this
// file has no business knowing about.

import gauge
import snug

/// The gauge's reading of a four-character string.
picked() -> int => fits("abcd")
